Why is it called StackOverflowError?
Every method call creates a stack frame.Infinite method calls keep adding stack frames. Stack memory gets exhausted (overflowed).
JVM throws StackOverflowError.

USER DEFINED EXCEPTION: Custom exception created by programmer.Usually extends RuntimeException.
----------------------
A user-defined exception can extend either:
