--------------------------------
byte              Byte
short             Short
int               Integer               ---> public final class Integer extends Number implements Comparator<Integer>  --> can't extend.
long              Long
float             Float
double            Double
char              Character
boolean           Boolean

All Wrapper Classes belong to java.lang package.
Why Wrapper Classes?:
1. Collections store objects only.
2. Required for Generics.
3. Provides utility methods.
4. Supports Boxing and Unboxing.
Ex: 
byte b = 20;
System.out.println(b);      // 20
Byte b1 = new Byte(b);
System.out.println(b1);     // 20

