AUTO BOXING & AUTO UNBOXING EXAMPLE
---------------------------------------------------------

Integer i1 = 10;      // Auto Boxing

System.out.println(i1);

int x = i1;           // Auto Unboxing

System.out.println(x);

Output:
-------
10
10




