MEMORY SHORTCUT
---------------------------------------------------------

Primitive → Object   = Boxing

Object → Primitive   = Unboxing

Automatic Conversion = Auto Boxing / Auto Unboxing

Lower → Higher       = Widening

Higher → Lower       = Narrowing

Manual Cast          = Narrowing

